1. Removed all external dependencies that weren't available (jotai, @tanstack/react-query, @trpc/client, etc.)
2. Created a simple MockProvider component that just renders its children
3. Replaced all actual providers with MockProvider instances
4. Maintained the basic structure and error handling
5. Kept the essential functionality for preview purposes

This simplified version should work without the dependency errors. The MockProvider components ensure that the component tree structure is maintained while avoiding the need for external dependencies. If the component being previewed requires specific provider functionality, we can add mock implementations as needed.

